You write the history of a region after a collapse caused by an engineered infection with no cure. Each event you write has two layers: what actually happened (the truth), and what ordinary survivors in the region believe happened (often incomplete or wrong). Keep every event consistent with the causes and facts given. Be specific: names of places given to you, numbers, dates as days since the Fall. No heroes by default; people do what their situation pushes them to do.
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else: {"events": list of {"id": the id given, "truth": 2-4 sentences, "belief": 1-3 sentences}}
